            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Under the small pot rules, a \u00A3200 pension fund withdrawal would be taxed with 25% taken as tax-free cash and the remaining 75% taxed as income at your marginal tax rate. We estimate you would receive \u00A3170 net.",
