        },
        {
          "text": "If your property is passed to direct descendants, a Main Residence Nil Rate Band (RNRB) of \u00A3175,000 can be used. Any unused NRB can be transferred to a surviving spouse or civil partner, meaning up to \u00A31 million can be passed on tax-free on second death.",
          "topic": "NRBTransfer",
